    "_comment": "# REVIEW: The room is a domed observatory. Blue-green light from slowly orbiting holographic planets. Foreground: a long conference table with a computer terminal. Midground: a slowly rotating gold dodecahedron hovering at eye level above the table. Background: computer monitors are mounted on the walls, two short robot sentinels at sealed blast doors, status lights blinking amber."
  },
  {
    "_comment": "# REVIEW: A 3D Earth diagram pulses with red satellite tracks on the far wall."
  },
  {
    "_comment": "# REVIEW: SERGEANT SIDEL [Venusian] — compact, mid-40s, follows the military regs faithfully. Classic Venusian military dress uniform: deep cobalt blue, high collar, gold piping at the shoulders and cuffs, regulation boots on short legs. Stands at attention: chin up, arms at sides, eyes forward. He has green skin, no hair except on top, big eyes, small nose and ears, big mounth, is short (5 feet or so, with short legs) and round (very wide waist)."
  },
  {
    "_comment": "# REVIEW: The GOVERNOR OF VENUS — a slowly rotating dodecahedron, about the size of Sidel's torso, hovers at eye level above the conference table. Translucent gold, it pulses brighter when speaking — individual words can flare and dim like breath. Speaks in a calm, authoritative female voice. Goes amber-orange in low-power mode. Goes dark when it exits. It has no face and needs none."
  },
